(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "新規リポジトリ gftdcojp/cloud-murakumo-market-analyst を、robotaxi-actor/\n    gftd-talent-actor/cloud-itonami と同型（LLM proposer ⊣ 独立 Governor ⊣\n    append-only ledger、langgraph-clj StateGraph、Phase 0→3）の market\n    分析 actor の正本と定める" "Governor(MarketGovernor)は grounding gate が中心: 数値主張は必ず\n    cloud-murakumo-market-intel の実在 :market/id を :cites で引用しなければ\n    ならない（HARD、人間承認でも覆せない）。:derived/:estimated な事実を\n    :measured であるかのように提示するのも HARD 違反" "staleness(:market/as-of 陳腐化)と confidence floor は SOFT(human\n    escalate)。:effect :publish-report は常に human approval 必須\n    (high-stakes、robotaxi の Minimal Risk Condition と同型)" "cloud-murakumo-market-intel を sibling west checkout への\n    {:local/root ...} 依存として参照する消費者であり、自身の ledger は\n    別グラフに持つ（データセットと ledger を混在させない）" "本ADRは Phase 0（mock advisor + MemStore のみ）の設計決定。実 LLM 配線・\n    実 Datomic/kotoba-server 接続・実 publish は follow-up")), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "cloud-murakumo-market-analyst-actor"), (:adr/related (vector "2607122000-cloud-murakumo-market-intel-dataset (このactorの一次知識源)" "gftdcojp/gftd-talent-actor (Store/Advisor/Governor/Phase/StateGraph 分割の直接の手本)" "cloud-itonami (ops-LLM ⊣ CertGovernor)" "robotaxi-actor (AR1 ⊣ SafetyGovernor, Minimal Risk Condition の由来)")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607122030-cloud-murakumo-market-analyst-actor"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-12"), (:adr/body "# ADR-2607122030: `gftdcojp/cloud-murakumo-market-analyst` — a governed market-analysis actor over `cloud-murakumo-market-intel`\n\nSee the paired .md file in this same directory for the full prose ADR (Context / Decision / Consequences / Related). This .edn is the queryable/authoritative-fact companion, not a duplicate."), (:adr/follow-up (vector "gh repo create gftdcojp/cloud-murakumo-market-analyst --private + push" "nbb scripts/gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry cloud-murakumo-market-analyst" "nbb scripts/gen-west-manifest.cljs --check" "Phase 1+: real langchain.model advisor wiring, real Datomic Local/kotoba-server backend, :effect :publish-report end-to-end demo")), (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki")), (:adr/date "2026-07-12"), (:adr/governor-checks (vector "1 grounding(HARD): 数値主張は実在 :market/id を cite しているか" "2 confidence-transparency(HARD): :derived/:estimated な事実を measured 扱いしていないか" "3 staleness(SOFT→escalate): 引用事実の :market/as-of が鮮度窓を超えていないか" "4 confidence-floor(SOFT→escalate): proposal :confidence が閾値未満でないか" "5 publish-gate(HARD, always-escalate): :effect :publish-report は常に human approval")), (:db/id -1), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607122030: gftdcojp/cloud-murakumo-market-analyst — a governed market-analysis actor over cloud-murakumo-market-intel"), (:adr/source-format "edn"), (:adr/corrections (vector))))